-- Dynamic signature of a proof-gated neural co-processor:
-- mode false = probing / observation-only; mode true = active coupled co-processing.
-- Activating requires a witness of W; decoupling is always unconditionally permitted (off-switch).
SafeGateDS : Sig → Sig → Type → DynSig
SafeGateDS Sp Sa W = (Bool , sg-sig Sp Sa W , sg-next Sp Sa W)
